Third-party software
--------------------

This product bundles the IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono typefaces
(src/editor/public/fonts/), Copyright © 2017 IBM Corp. with Reserved Font
Name "Plex", licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(see src/editor/public/fonts/OFL.txt).

Page layouts may use the Inter, Manrope, DM Sans, Newsreader, Playfair Display
and Plus Jakarta Sans typefaces
(library/fonts/, Latin subsets from Fontsource), each licensed under the SIL
Open Font License, Version 1.1 (see library/fonts/*-OFL.txt). A page that
uses one gets a copy of its font file in its assets/ folder.

It depends on open-source packages, including the Model Context Protocol
TypeScript SDK, Playwright, Zod and tsx, each under its own license; their
license and copyright notices are kept in their distributions.

